## Final Thoughts

Using story points really helped us stay on track. Our estimates were pretty accurate, and we were able to finish all the features as planned. Each teammate picked tasks that matched their strengths, and we worked together using Git, Discord, and Google Docs to communicate and share progress. Overall, this method made the whole project smoother and more organized .